<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.4667px;">REI Nation Investors<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;">The Clothier Family wants to manage your property!</span><span lang="EN" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">--<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: justify;"><span lang="EN" style="color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">Did you know that your properties qualify for our group insurance program with reduced premiums if managed by Premier Property Management? Let us help you lower your costs, and increase your return. If you have other properties </span><span lang="EN">not purchased from REI Nation, we want the opportunity to assist you with management, and offer you this incredible benefit.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 10pt 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: justify;"><span lang="EN">We are pleased to now extend this offer to you as a current client.&nbsp; If you have properties <span style="color: rgb(5, 5, 5);">in any of the 8 cities we are currently operating in, </span>Premier Property Management/ PPMG of Texas<span style="color: rgb(5, 5, 5);"> is ready to help! </span>The properties can be vacant or occupied. We are currently in the following 8 markets, and ready to serve you:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN">Memphis, TN - St Louis, MO - Dallas, TX -&nbsp; Houston, TX - San Antonio, TX -&nbsp; Oklahoma City, OK - Tulsa, OK -&nbsp; Little Rock, AR<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b><span lang="EN">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span lang="EN" style="">To read our latest press release surrounding this information, click </span></b><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span lang="EN"><a href="https://blog.reination.com/going-growing-into-new-opportunities-with-premier-property-management-group?utm_campaign=Bi-weekly%20Newsletter%20-%20Tuesday%20-%20Q4%202020&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsmi=98348592&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_OKptf4E7sUdIjVL6orjAIFZP5oYq-sxDLe4mcO36KLmnnSyXl0A6KcEzx_dFwueJ6b70NUiAlwmz0kbY8FpKwaqp9EgcCKdhkM9RdoDGtbHcs-wo&amp;utm_content=98348592&amp;utm_source=hs_email">here</a>.</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px; text-align: center;"><span lang="EN">--<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 16.8667px;"><span lang="EN">If you are int